 ],
 "notes": "Models the Main Building (Päärakennus, Seminaarinkatu 15; Aalto 1954-56) on Seminaarinmäki, not the whole campus. Photos show: the entrance between a tall rectangular brick classroom wing (left, three storeys, one corner window under a white frame) and the fan-shaped auditorium wing (right) whose brick wall rises toward the east, steps up to a dark recessed doorway; the auditorium wing's glazed ground floor (library) on the forest side with a dark fascia; low red-brick wings with red tin roofs along the sports ground; pines and birches. Guessed: all dimensions (from proportions against the figure and storeys), the fan wing's true curved plan (stepped here as a wedge of brick over a box), the placement of the sports-ground wings, north orientation. Interior photos (skylights, stair) unused. Round 3: classroom wing given window ribbons by storey; entrance block lowered to brick."
}